# Names of every secret and setting this project needs. No values, ever.
# Copy to .env (ignored by git) and fill in, or better, load from your
# secrets manager. See docs/SECRETS.md.
#
# One line per variable, with a comment saying what it is for, which
# environments need it, and where to get it.

# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=        # what it is for; needed in: local, demo, production; from: <where>
